type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Substitution states the image under a functional relation is a set.</li>\n<li>这是 Replacement 模式的一个公式实例；单个实例不与整个 Replacement 模式“等价”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\nA\\in V\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in A\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\right)\n\\to\\exists B\\in V\\;\\forall y\\;\\left(y\\in B\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in A\\;\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":800,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4000","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-prop-substitution.md|58-prop-substitution]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}